# Right-clicks are press-and-hold here (the DSL's click is the left button).
# Coordinates: IRICE-TEST 1920x1080, scale 1, the default Control Center layout
# (setup below resets it). Material grid: x0 1512, y0 50, columns 94 apart
# (86 wide), rows 80 apart (72 tall). Glass grid: x0 1560, y0 50, columns
# and rows 82.5 apart (72.5). Default layout rows: 0 Wi-Fi 2x1 + Now Playing
# 2x2; 1 Bluetooth, Night Light; 2 Focus 2x1, Stages, Dark Mode; 3 Display;
# 4 Sound; 5 Screenshot, Record, Caffeine, Clipboard; 6 Mirroring 2x1.
look material
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=[];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
rec toggle 1 ptr move 1555 166 sleep 50 click
note Bluetooth toggles; corner ×0.7 on press, springs back
ptr move 1555 166 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 0.5
shot hold
note menu or page opens; no toggle on release
key -k Escape
ptr move 1860 638 sleep 50 click
wait 0.5
shot editing
note Edit controls
rec drag 1.5 ptr move 1555 166 sleep 50 down sleep 50 glide 1743 166 400 sleep 50 up
note the tile lands in its new slot; no offset left
ptr move 1555 166 sleep 50 down sleep 300
shot press-editing
ptr up
note no tint, corner unchanged while editing
ptr move 1530 70 sleep 50 click
wait 0.5
note Done (top-left back arrow)
key -k Tab -k Tab
key -M shift -k F10 -m shift
wait 0.5
shot shift-f10
note the focused tile's page or menu opens
ipc panels close
